    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"authentic experience\" you're talking about... it feels like it's not even in this world. i look at people worrying about their jobs or their cars or whatever, and it just seems so meaningless. like, i've seen what real life and death look like, and this stuff? it's just noise. i don't think i'm meant to be part of this anymore.",
